<view class="container"><view class="eyebrow">LET GOOD THINGS CIRCULATE</view><view class="title">{{id ? '编辑这件好物' : '给闲置一次新的出发'}}</view><view class="muted">免费发布，无平台佣金。提交后经审核公开展示。</view><view class="photo-list"><view class="photo-item" wx:for="{{photos}}" wx:key="id"><image mode="aspectFill" src="{{item.url}}"/><view class="photo-remove" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removePhoto">×</view></view><view class="add-photo" wx:if="{{photos.length &lt; 6}}" bindtap="addPhoto"><text>＋</text><text>{{uploading ? '正在上传…' : '添加照片（1–6 张）'}}</text></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">商品名称</text><input value="{{title}}" bindinput="input" data-field="title" maxlength="40" placeholder="例如：九成新护眼台灯"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">商品简介</text><textarea value="{{description}}" bindinput="input" data-field="description" maxlength="1000" placeholder="描述成色、使用时间、瑕疵和配件，让同学更了解它。"/><text class="muted">{{description.length}} / 1000</text></view><view class="split"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">分类</text><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" bindchange="pick" data-field="categoryIndex"><view class="picker-box">{{categories[categoryIndex] || '加载中'}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">数量</text><input type="number" value="{{quantity}}" bindinput="input" data-field="quantity" maxlength="3"/></view></view><view class="split"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">单价（元）</text><input type="digit" value="{{price}}" bindinput="input" data-field="price" placeholder="0.00" maxlength="9"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">交付方式</text><picker range="{{deliveryOptions}}" value="{{deliveryIndex}}" bindchange="pick" data-field="deliveryIndex"><view class="picker-box">{{deliveryOptions[deliveryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">{{deliveryIndex ? '送达范围 / 说明（选填）' : '自取交接地点（必填）'}}</text><input value="{{location}}" bindinput="input" data-field="location" maxlength="120" placeholder="建议选择图书馆、食堂门口等公共地点"/></view><view class="split"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">联系类型</text><picker range="{{contactOptions}}" value="{{contactIndex}}" bindchange="pick" data-field="contactIndex"><view class="picker-box">{{contactOptions[contactIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">联系方式</text><input value="{{contact_value}}" bindinput="input" data-field="contact_value" maxlength="50" placeholder="供有意向的同学联系"/></view></view><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label class="consent"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{consent}}" color="#285845"/>我同意向登录用户展示所填联系方式和交接地点，并确认图片、描述真实，有权出售该物品。</label></checkbox-group><view class="error">{{error}}</view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy || uploading}}" disabled="{{busy || uploading || !ready}}">提交审核 ↗</button><view class="muted">编辑后会重新审核；物品在线下成交后请及时标记已售。</view></view>
